/-!
# Structure constants of `𝔤₂`

`g2T` is the table of `𝔤₂` in the basis of folding a simply-laced algebra by a diagram automorphism (`aff_fold.py`), stored as flat rows (`SCLie.tableOf`): row `i` lists
`j c k` for `⁅bᵢ, bⱼ⁆ ∋ k · b_c`.  Generated by an untrusted script, not part of the library.  This file
checks index bounds and antisymmetry; the Jacobi identity is checked in `G2Jac*`.
-/

